       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. MEMBERSHIP-DISCOUNT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 MEMBER-TIER PIC X.
       01 PURCHASE-AMOUNT PIC 9(5)V99.
       01 DISCOUNT-AMOUNT PIC 9(5)V99.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING MEMBER-TIER PURCHASE-AMOUNT DISCOUNT-AMOUNT.
           EVALUATE MEMBER-TIER
             WHEN 'G' COMPUTE DISCOUNT-AMOUNT = PURCHASE-AMOUNT * 0.10
             WHEN 'S' COMPUTE DISCOUNT-AMOUNT = PURCHASE-AMOUNT * 0.05
             WHEN OTHER MOVE ZERO TO DISCOUNT-AMOUNT
           END-EVALUATE
           GOBACK.
